{"id":"u09","level":"A1","emoji":"🌦️","title":{"t":"Das Wetter","s":"The weather","a":"audio/de-en/68507221f8eb.mp3"},"goals":["Talk about the weather: Es ist sonnig. Es regnet.","Name the months and the four seasons","Say when: im Juli, im Sommer","Say when your birthday is"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"das Wetter","s":"weather","emoji":"⛅","ex":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter?","s":"What's the weather like?","a":"audio/de-en/94b4941ac169.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26c5.svg","a":"audio/de-en/41d42d5c6fbe.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"die Sonne","pl":"die Sonnen","s":"sun","emoji":"☀️","ex":{"t":"Die Sonne scheint.","s":"The sun is shining.","a":"audio/de-en/26cc903987ec.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2600.svg","a":"audio/de-en/0492c2aefefe.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/5674da876a6f.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"der Regen","s":"rain","emoji":"🌧️","ex":{"t":"Ich mag Regen.","s":"I like rain.","a":"audio/de-en/4608bb75c9ed.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f327.svg","a":"audio/de-en/139ac8ae6b65.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"der Schnee","s":"snow","emoji":"❄️","ex":{"t":"Im Winter gibt es Schnee.","s":"There is snow in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/1306320f46b8.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2744.svg","a":"audio/de-en/90df4e9ab906.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"der Wind","pl":"die Winde","s":"wind","emoji":"🌬️","ex":{"t":"Der Wind ist kalt.","s":"The wind is cold.","a":"audio/de-en/f7208632cb9a.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f32c.svg","a":"audio/de-en/26edf3861eb9.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/be6c22375b5c.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"sonnig","s":"sunny","emoji":"🌞","ex":{"t":"Heute ist es sonnig.","s":"It's sunny today.","a":"audio/de-en/6061f860df17.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f31e.svg","a":"audio/de-en/2600a131ad29.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"warm","s":"warm","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Im Frühling ist es warm.","s":"It's warm in spring.","a":"audio/de-en/704ffc7c9ec2.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/0219efc9e6aa.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"kalt","s":"cold","emoji":"🥶","ex":{"t":"Im Winter ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/2576c53dacba.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f976.svg","a":"audio/de-en/89a74e2918f4.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"regnen","s":"to rain","emoji":"☔","ex":{"t":"Es regnet.","s":"It's raining.","a":"audio/de-en/3ec13f13515b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2614.svg","a":"audio/de-en/e3cd112ce9c1.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"der Frühling","pl":"die Frühlinge","s":"spring","emoji":"🌷","ex":{"t":"Nouruz ist im Frühling.","s":"Nowruz is in spring.","a":"audio/de-en/e1cd2e816442.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f337.svg","a":"audio/de-en/8e86942fc95e.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/9f8124dc78d0.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"der Sommer","pl":"die Sommer","s":"summer","emoji":"🏖️","ex":{"t":"Im Sommer ist es heiß.","s":"It's hot in summer.","a":"audio/de-en/1705ed051ed7.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f3d6.svg","a":"audio/de-en/eddfb7931398.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/0ff6aa2ae5f2.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"der Herbst","pl":"die Herbste","s":"fall, autumn","emoji":"🍂","ex":{"t":"Im Herbst ist es windig.","s":"It's windy in the fall.","a":"audio/de-en/210e657a7994.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f342.svg","a":"audio/de-en/2a4abd679bc4.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/31ebcb410012.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"der Winter","pl":"die Winter","s":"winter","emoji":"⛄","ex":{"t":"Im Winter schneit es.","s":"It snows in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/9fdee0852026.mp3"},"img":"img/e/26c4.svg","a":"audio/de-en/296535ae5ab4.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/c8a307395c3e.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"der Monat","pl":"die Monate","s":"month","emoji":"📅","ex":{"t":"Ein Jahr hat zwölf Monate.","s":"A year has twelve months.","a":"audio/de-en/4d5b1456fd75.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4c5.svg","a":"audio/de-en/94974edcfb46.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/c69805a62cb5.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Wie ist das Wetter heute?","s":"What's the weather like today?","a":"audio/de-en/78fcdb173499.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Es regnet.","s":"It's raining.","a":"audio/de-en/3ec13f13515b.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Es schneit.","s":"It's snowing.","a":"audio/de-en/782948f3679d.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Es ist heiß!","s":"It's hot!","a":"audio/de-en/d866059ceb38.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Es ist zwanzig Grad.","s":"It's twenty degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/ed0869067ed6.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Wann hast du Geburtstag?","s":"When is your birthday?","a":"audio/de-en/c30f90aefc56.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.","s":"My birthday is in May.","a":"audio/de-en/5ab3a6fe983f.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Frohes neues Jahr!","s":"Happy New Year!","a":"audio/de-en/4e2faab85d07.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter in Teheran?","s":"What's the weather like in Tehran?","a":"audio/de-en/1342bd577575.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Anna","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Reza","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hallo, Reza! Wie ist das Wetter in Teheran?","s":"Hi Reza! What's the weather like in Tehran?","a":"audio/de-en/656ceaf37fc5.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Hallo, Anna! Hier ist es sonnig und warm. Es ist zwanzig Grad.","s":"Hi Anna! Here it's sunny and warm. It's twenty degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/4a50b24c96aa.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Toll! In Berlin regnet es. Es ist kalt und windig.","s":"Great! In Berlin it's raining. It's cold and windy.","a":"audio/de-en/6d87d258b233.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Oh nein! Wie kalt ist es?","s":"Oh no! How cold is it?","a":"audio/de-en/5cf86a2811d6.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Es ist fünf Grad.","s":"It's five degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/128fe207b853.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Der Frühling in Teheran ist schön. Und im März ist Nouruz!","s":"Spring in Tehran is beautiful. And in March it's Nowruz!","a":"audio/de-en/1b1f7c731f5e.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Nouruz? Was ist das?","s":"Nowruz? What's that?","a":"audio/de-en/74dcf0d7271d.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Das ist das Neujahrsfest im Iran.","s":"It's the New Year festival in Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/48499b32f61f.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Schön! Dann frohes neues Jahr, Reza!","s":"How nice! Then happy New Year, Reza!","a":"audio/de-en/dfdd8f140a13.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Danke, Anna! Tschüss!","s":"Thanks, Anna! Bye!","a":"audio/de-en/b53830fcc098.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"Es regnet. Es ist kalt.","s":"Talking about the weather with es"},"explain":"German weather sentences use **es** (it) – just like in English.\nWith an adjective, use **es ist**: **Es ist sonnig. Es ist kalt. Es ist windig.**\nWith a weather verb, use **es** + verb: **Es regnet** (it's raining), **Es schneit** (it's snowing). German has no -ing form, so **es regnet** means both *it rains* and *it is raining*.\nRemember the verb-second rule: **Heute regnet es. Im Winter ist es kalt.**","table":[["sonnig","Es ist sonnig."],["warm / heiß","Es ist warm. / Es ist heiß."],["kalt","Es ist kalt."],["windig","Es ist windig."],["regnen","Es regnet."],["schneien","Es schneit."]],"examples":[{"t":"Heute ist es sonnig.","s":"It's sunny today.","a":"audio/de-en/6061f860df17.mp3"},{"t":"Es regnet und es ist kalt.","s":"It's raining and it's cold.","a":"audio/de-en/f15a14b65c77.mp3"},{"t":"Im Winter schneit es.","s":"It snows in winter.","a":"audio/de-en/9fdee0852026.mp3"},{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter? – Es ist warm.","s":"What's the weather like? – It's warm.","a":"audio/de-en/f9ca4cbff04f.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Es ___ sonnig.","options":["regnet","ist","hat"],"answer":1,"s":"It's sunny.","full":"Es ist sonnig.","a":"audio/de-en/d547a3fa114b.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Heute ___ es.","options":["regnet","ist","regnen"],"answer":0,"s":"It's raining today.","full":"Heute regnet es.","a":"audio/de-en/8aca9aea5ffb.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ schneit.","answer":["Es"],"s":"It's snowing.","full":"Es schneit.","a":"audio/de-en/782948f3679d.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Im Sommer ist ___ heiß.","options":["er","sie","es"],"answer":2,"s":"It's hot in summer.","full":"Im Sommer ist es heiß.","a":"audio/de-en/1705ed051ed7.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Es ___ kalt.","answer":["ist"],"s":"It's cold.","full":"Es ist kalt.","a":"audio/de-en/11f3f46eb712.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Im Winter ___.","options":["es schneit","schneit es","schneien es"],"answer":1,"s":"It snows in winter.","full":"Im Winter schneit es.","a":"audio/de-en/9fdee0852026.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Heute ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold today.","full":"Heute ist es kalt.","a":"audio/de-en/171e6dc8f2a2.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Die Sonne scheint.","s":"The sun is shining.","full":"Die Sonne scheint.","a":"audio/de-en/26cc903987ec.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"im Juli, im Sommer","s":"Months, seasons and im"},"explain":"All months and seasons are **masculine**: **der Juli, der Sommer**.\nTo say *in* a month or a season, use **im** (= in dem): **im Juli, im Winter**.\nThe months look a lot like English, so they're easy to learn. Watch the spelling: **März, Mai, Juni, Juli, Oktober, Dezember**.\nBirthdays: **Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.** (My birthday is in May.)","table":[["der Frühling","März · April · Mai"],["der Sommer","Juni · Juli · August"],["der Herbst","September · Oktober · November"],["der Winter","Dezember · Januar · Februar"]],"examples":[{"t":"Im Juli ist es heiß.","s":"It's hot in July.","a":"audio/de-en/eba38d301e4c.mp3"},{"t":"Im Dezember schneit es.","s":"It snows in December.","a":"audio/de-en/99bc8cccb9dd.mp3"},{"t":"Ich habe im Mai Geburtstag.","s":"My birthday is in May.","a":"audio/de-en/5ab3a6fe983f.mp3"},{"t":"Im Herbst ist es windig.","s":"It's windy in the fall.","a":"audio/de-en/210e657a7994.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich habe ___ Juni Geburtstag.","options":["in der","im","um"],"answer":1,"s":"My birthday is in June.","full":"Ich habe im Juni Geburtstag.","a":"audio/de-en/f225e1d413ff.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Im Frühling: März, April und ___.","options":["Juli","Oktober","Mai"],"answer":2,"s":"In spring: March, April and May.","full":"Im Frühling: März, April und Mai.","a":"audio/de-en/3139f9c83e27.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Januar, Februar, ___, April","answer":["März","Maerz"],"s":"January, February, March, April","full":"Januar, Februar, März, April","a":"audio/de-en/ae32f2b37d73.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Im Juni, Juli und August ist ___.","answer":["Sommer"],"s":"In June, July and August it's summer.","full":"Im Juni, Juli und August ist Sommer.","a":"audio/de-en/ba158a0df593.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"___ Herbst regnet es.","options":["Im","In der","Am"],"answer":0,"s":"It rains in the fall.","full":"Im Herbst regnet es.","a":"audio/de-en/12b632421e6c.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Dezember, Januar und Februar sind im ___.","options":["Sommer","Winter","Frühling"],"answer":1,"s":"December, January and February are in winter.","full":"Dezember, Januar und Februar sind im Winter.","a":"audio/de-en/7b51578ccdba.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Im Winter ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold in winter.","full":"Im Winter ist es kalt.","a":"audio/de-en/2576c53dacba.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Die Jahreszeiten in Deutschland","s":"The seasons in Germany","a":"audio/de-en/ec38c0d64e23.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"In Deutschland gibt es vier Jahreszeiten.","s":"In Germany there are four seasons.","a":"audio/de-en/b5ec1cfe9924.mp3"},{"t":"Im Frühling ist es warm, aber es regnet auch.","s":"In spring it's warm, but it also rains.","a":"audio/de-en/8f76240088ee.mp3"},{"t":"Im Sommer scheint die Sonne. Es ist warm oder heiß.","s":"In summer the sun shines. It's warm or hot.","a":"audio/de-en/fb035fd25f15.mp3"},{"t":"Im Herbst ist es windig und es regnet.","s":"In the fall it's windy and it rains.","a":"audio/de-en/eba99f6ba5eb.mp3"},{"t":"Im Winter ist es kalt und es schneit.","s":"In winter it's cold and it snows.","a":"audio/de-en/5fbc51233d25.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas mag den Sommer.","s":"Lukas likes summer.","a":"audio/de-en/eb8850ce7af8.mp3"},{"t":"Anna mag den Winter. Sie hat im Dezember Geburtstag.","s":"Anna likes winter. Her birthday is in December.","a":"audio/de-en/8c8073442c94.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Wie viele Jahreszeiten gibt es?","s":"How many seasons are there?","a":"audio/de-en/7fd9de2cee60.mp3"},"options":["drei","vier","zwölf"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter im Herbst?","s":"What's the weather like in the fall?","a":"audio/de-en/d875052c3a16.mp3"},"options":["Es ist heiß.","Es schneit.","Es ist windig und es regnet."],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Wann hat Anna Geburtstag?","s":"When is Anna's birthday?","a":"audio/de-en/b5241c4194fa.mp3"},"options":["im Dezember","im Juli","im Mai"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Was mag Lukas?","s":"What does Lukas like?","a":"audio/de-en/d9b80e6e2cce.mp3"},"options":["den Winter","den Sommer","den Regen"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Wie ist das Wetter heute?","s":"What's the weather like today?","a":"audio/de-en/78fcdb173499.mp3"},{"t":"Heute ist es sonnig und warm.","s":"Today it's sunny and warm.","a":"audio/de-en/66ffc10d94a2.mp3"},{"t":"Im Januar ist es kalt.","s":"It's cold in January.","a":"audio/de-en/0d32b59af155.mp3"},{"t":"Im August ist es heiß.","s":"It's hot in August.","a":"audio/de-en/9e02cfbd18a5.mp3"},{"t":"Ich habe im April Geburtstag.","s":"My birthday is in April.","a":"audio/de-en/59631cd0a25d.mp3"},{"t":"Es ist minus zwei Grad.","s":"It's minus two degrees.","a":"audio/de-en/dd01c75a6afd.mp3"},{"t":"Wir mögen den Frühling.","s":"We like spring.","a":"audio/de-en/e64c90db9649.mp3"},{"t":"Im Herbst regnet es.","s":"It rains in the fall.","a":"audio/de-en/12b632421e6c.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f326.svg"}